## What's included

A short, focused engagement to get the fundamentals right before any design or marketing work starts.

- Customer and competitor research
- Positioning and messaging workshop
- Brand voice and tone guide
- Core copy for homepage, about, and services

## How it works

Two workshops over three weeks. Async feedback between sessions. End with a short strategy doc and a set of approved messaging pillars.

## Good fit for

Founders who've been in market for a year or two, are getting traction, and are ready to sharpen the pitch.
